# Data — never commit raw/processed corpus or tokenized shards
data/raw/
data/processed/
data/cleaned/
data/deduped/
data/shards/train/
data/shards/val/
data/*.bin
data/*.npy

# Tokenizer artifacts (large binary files — regenerable from scripts)
tokenizer/vocab.json
tokenizer/merges.txt
tokenizer/*.model
# Keep metadata (version hash + stats) — these ARE committed
# tokenizer/tokenizer_version.json  <-- committed
# tokenizer/bytes_per_token.json    <-- committed

# Checkpoints and logs
checkpoints/
*.pt
*.ckpt
logs/
*.log

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# Generated reports (regenerable via scripts/generate_report.py)
reports/

# Env / secrets
.env
*.pem

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
